Hi Robert,

You shouldn't have to filter out unmodified peptides before input into the converter (the converter should filter them out). However if you have certain modifications that you want to ensure are removed, than it would make sense to perform a pre-filtering to ensure only phospho peptides are included. We are still building additional filtering steps into the converter so hopefully this will be a feature in the future.

Hope this helps!

Devon

